SY_TALK("Pmcateb8VyA",[[3930,["Swadishthan, Thinking, Illness Part 2, Sydney, Australia, 19900316"]],[3936,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[3953,["I’m happy you all are enjoying this music and this dancing,"]],[3957,["and about these artists, I have to say that after coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3963,["at a very young age, they achieved such mastery."]],[3967,["Because, when the Kundalini rises, as I told you,"]],[3971,["She enriches your centres."]],[3976,["The centre about which I was going to talk to you today is the centre of creativity,"]],[3986,["which looks after your power of action, physical and mental."]],[4002,["This power of action moves on the right side of the spinal cord"]],[4010,["and coming to the optic chiasma, it crosses over,"]],[4014,["passes to the left side and creates an institution called ego."]],[4024,["The institution of ego is a myth."]],[4032,["What we do is to get something dead, like some trees dead,"]],[4037,["so make some platform or some furniture."]],[4042,["We take some stones and make a hall,"]],[4046,["and we think we have done a great job."]],[4049,["Actually, what we have done is to reconstructed the dead."]],[4055,["But while doing it, we get the feeling that we have done it, something."]],[4060,["That is how our ego develops."]],[4067,["This channel on the right-hand side caters to your future."]],[4076,["So those people who plan too much, think too much,"]],[4083,["exhaust the energy of this centre"]],[4087,["because this centre has the first responsibility"]],[4093,["to convert the fat cells in the stomach for the use of the brain,"]],[4098,["which is overused, to make them into grey cells."]],[4106,["So, when you start thinking too much,"]],[4110,["it has to work more for this very important function."]],[4118,["When it starts working for one function,"]],[4121,["the other functions are neglected."]],[4125,["And the other functions are:"]],[4128,["it has to cater, to nourish or to give energy to your liver,"]],[4135,["to your pancreas, to your spleen, to your kidneys and part of your intestine."]],[4145,["So, once you start neglecting these organs,"]],[4151,["first your liver suffers."]],[4156,["Means, the function of liver gets limited."]],[4160,["The function basically of the liver, basically, is"]],[4166,["to absorb the heat of the body which is the poison"]],[4172,["and allow it to permeate into the bloodstream."]],[4180,["But the energy is so limited that it cannot function properly."]],[4187,["So, this centre starts neglecting liver"]],[4194,["and liver then cannot get rid of all the heat of the body,"]],[4201,["so the heat starts flowing upward."]],[4207,["When it starts flowing upward, then there’s a centre,"]],[4210,["what you call as the Right Heart, which gets affected."]],[4216,["People develop a disease called asthma with it."]],[4222,["Also, they develop a disease"]],[4224,["what you call as a massive heart attack, on the left-hand side,"]],[4229,["when the heat reaches there."]],[4231,["They also can develop a paralysis of the right side"]],[4237,["when it reaches the brain."]],[4241,["The vulnerability is there."]],[4245,["And then it’s triggered somehow by the left side action, maybe."]],[4254,["Such people are futuristic, they go on planning for the future."]],[4259,["Future doesn’t exist, only the present is the truth."]],[4265,["But they go on planning about future, waste their energies"]],[4269,["and ultimately find that all their plans fail."]],[4273,["One must know the Divine plan."]],[4276,["If you know the Divine plan, then you don’t have to plan"]],[4280,["because you know the Divine is already planning for you everything."]],[4284,["When you understand after Realisation that everything is done"]],[4288,["by Paramchaitanya, by this All-Pervading Power, by this Ruh,"]],[4293,["then you do not think that you are doing something."]],[4300,["Moreover, as I told you,"]],[4303,["when the Kundalini rises through the Agnya Chakra,"]],[4307,["both these institutions of ego and superego are sucked in,"]],[4312,["so there is no ego, so you become egoless,"]],[4317,["so your karmas or your duties or your so-called work"]],[4322,["you have done become akarmas.","Then you don’t talk like this,"]],[4327,["that “I have done this, I have done that.”"]],[4329,["They say, “Oh it’s rising, it’s happening, it’s working out.”"]],[4333,["You start speaking in the third person."]],[4336,["Even sometimes children you will find they talk like that."]],[4340,["“This little boy won’t go because it is obstinate.” They’ll talk about themselves."]],[4346,["If you notice, if they’re realised souls, they’ll talk like that,"]],[4349,["in the third person."]],[4353,["So, you become a third person."]],[4358,["And nourishment to this centre comes through your Realisation"]],[4364,["as the Kundalini is connected to the mains."]],[4368,["As a result, you get into balance."]],[4371,["You are in thoughtless awareness."]],[4374,["Somebody has asked Me about the thinking, yesterday."]],[4377,["So, the thought arises from the past or from the future."]],[4383,["As we have a capacity to react,"]],[4387,["because of the construction of our body as a prism."]],[4392,["It’s a little scientific thing, but if you listen to some of My lectures,"]],[4397,["you’ll understand what I mean."]],[4400,["Now what happens, when you see something, you react,"]],[4402,["anything you see, you react. You see this carpet, you’ll react."]],[4406,["You’ll see this mic, you’ll react. You’ll think something about it."]],[4414,["So, a thought comes either from the future or from the past"]],[4420,["and there’s a wave of thought coming and going,"]],[4423,["again thought coming and going. It comes and disappears."]],[4432,["In between these thoughts, there’s a little space which is the present."]],[4437,["But if I say \"you pay attention to yourself, to your present\","]],[4441,["you cannot, unless and until you are a realised soul."]],[4446,["So, when the Kundalini rises, these thoughts become –"]],[4449,["they lean out, means they become thin."]],[4452,["When they become thin, the space in between increases"]],[4458,["and that’s how you become thoughtlessly aware."]],[4462,["So, the thinking is minimised,"]],[4467,["then the liver doesn’t have to do all the time the job of converting"]],[4470,["your fat cells into grey cells."]],[4476,["It comes into balance."]],[4479,["Then the second one is the pancreas. That is neglected, too."]],[4486,["In a person who is futuristic, who thinks too much, plans too much,"]],[4490,["that also becomes neglected."]],[4494,["Now, the function of the pancreas is to absorb"]],[4499,["the sugar into bloodstream in a proper way."]],[4509,["But because it is neglected, it has a very limited energy,"]],[4513,["it cannot function, so you get diabetes."]],[4518,["Because of too much thinking, you get diabetes."]],[4522,["As I told you yesterday that in India, if you have to give tea to someone,"]],[4529,["be careful if he is from a village,"]],[4532,["because in the village, you have to put so much sugar"]],[4536,["that the spoon should stand at right angles. Otherwise, it’s no tea for them."]],[4541,["And they never get diabetes, never get diabetes."]],[4545,["Diabetes is the headache of the people who sit on chairs, write,"]],[4550,["think,worry and are time bound."]],[4556,["All such people get diabetes. They’re futuristic,"]],[4564,["egoistical, arrogant, hot-tempered."]],[4570,["And such people get also heart attacks which are of a massive nature."]],[4576,["The Left Heart is connected in a way,"]],[4583,["when there’s too much of exertion on the physical side also"]],[4588,["one can get heart attack."]],[4592,["The another type of heart attack one gets is angina,"]],[4596,["that’s due to some other reason, that’s due to the lethargic heart."]],[4601,["So now we have another problem which is very serious is that of the spleen."]],[4608,["Spleen is the speedometer. It’s the one that gives us rhythm."]],[4614,["If we are rhythmic in life, spleen keeps all right."]],[4619,["But we are very hectic."]],[4622,["And the function of the spleen is to create red blood corpuscles"]],[4630,["whenever there is an emergency."]],[4635,["So, the way we are, we are always under a shock."]],[4638,["Early in the morning you get up, what do you see?"]],[4643,["You read the newspaper, horrid news."]],[4650,["I mean newspapers have to give horrid news, they never give good news, you know."]],[4654,["They say, “We don’t want to say if some plane has landed safely.”"]],[4657,["But if there’s a disaster, so many have died, killed in action,"]],[4665,["murders, horrible things, naturally you get a shock,"]],[4670,["because you are a human being and in a subconscious you feel,"]],[4678,["in unconscious area, you get the jerk. There’s a shock."]],[4685,["Then you start"]],[4689,["the day in a hectic way, you are time-bound, you have to rush,"]],[4692,["you can’t take your breakfast, you just take something, grab,"]],[4696,["rush to the car or maybe on anything"]],[4698,["and then you find the jam in modern days."]],[4701,["Everything keeps you on a tension. Then you reach the office,"]],[4705,["there’s the boss who’s getting angry with you because you’re late."]],[4709,["As it is, I don’t know how much work we really produce."]],[4713,["Only the mess we have created in this world, I think,"]],[4715,["much more in the modern times than much work."]],[4720,["We cannot have people like Mozart nowadays,"]],[4723,["we can’t have anyone like Michelangelo,"]],[4730,["we cannot have any artists who can create beautiful things,"]],[4735,["we do not have beautiful buildings now, horrible, plastics."]],[4740,["We cannot have beautiful, artistic clothes."]],[4746,["Everything is becoming plastic and for which,"]],[4750,["we are working so very hard to create plastic mountains."]],[4758,["All this leads to tensions, so we become tense."]],[4764,["And the tensions go on increasing as this ego increases,"]],[4769,["covers all your head and you go into tension."]],[4777,["But the worst thing that happens to you that this spleen"]],[4781,["which is the one responsible for keeping the rhythm of your life, goes hectic"]],[4788,["and becomes crazy, doesn’t understand what sort of a personality you are."]],[4794,["Sometimes you rush to that, sometimes you rush to that."]],[4797,["There’s no rhythm in the life."]],[4800,["So, it gets upset"]],[4806,["and it starts producing red blood corpuscles unrhythmically,"]],[4811,["it doesn’t know. So, the vulnerability is there."]],[4815,["And as soon as there’s any triggering from the left side,"]],[4819,["you develop a horrible disease called blood cancer,"]],[4823,["and the only treatment you can have in the medical science is that"]],[4826,["you’ll be certified that you’ll die after eight days or after one month."]],[4832,["That’s the only possibility."]],[4837,["But, with Kundalini awakening, your own power nourishes this centre"]],[4846,["and supplies energy, soothes down your hectic speedometer."]],[4855,["which is the spleen. and the disease gets cured."]],[4860,["There are many we know of who got their blood cancer cured"]],[4866,["and even after six, seven years they’re living and kicking all right."]],[4873,["All this is available to you within yourself."]],[4876,["This is all been promised. Many great people have written about it."]],[4881,["It’s not that I’m saying something new. Only the new thing"]],[4885,["we are seeing here is that you can get en masse Realisation."]],[4892,["Then is the kidney. Kidney also gets affected,"]],[4895,["firstly by the heat of the liver, secondly"]],[4900,["by the strenuous type of life you lead, futuristic, neglected,"]],[4908,["and then you get blood pressures."]],[4912,["Blood pressures you get till you get failure of your kidneys"]],[4915,["or you might get a paralysis, anything is possible."]],[4920,["So, we have blood pressure, high blood pressure."]],[4927,["All this is only because of one centre, when it is out of gear."]],[4932,["But if all the seven centres are out of gear,"]],[4935,["what should happen to us?"]],[4940,["And I think the modern life is such that it could be,"]],[4945,["all centres could be in danger."]],[4948,["So, it is eminent, is important that we should get"]],[4954,["our Kundalini awakened and we should enjoy the best health."]],[4961,["Health of course you enjoy very well, no doubt. But apart from health,"]],[4967,["apart from health, apart from health,"]],[4974,["you enjoy many other things. First of all, you enjoy yourself."]],[4980,["Today there’s no time to discuss all the centres, but still I would say"]],[4986,["that I would like to give you all the benefits of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[4992,["which are possible, that you start enjoying others."]],[5001,["You become righteous, as I told you,"]],[5004,["and you start enjoying your virtues."]],[5008,["You are no more a critic of things. If you have to criticise,"]],[5014,["you criticise yourself, laugh at yourself and you don’t laugh at others."]],[5021,["You start connecting yourself, if you have the art of Kundalini awakening,"]],[5028,["because yoga means, of course, the union with the Divine."]],[5032,["Also means ‘yukti’, meaning ‘the deftness’,"]],[5035,["deftness to raise the Kundalini of yours and of others."]],[5046,["If you know the decoding of these centres,"]],[5051,["of these centres on your fingertips –"]],[5055,["five, six and seven on the left side and five, six and seven on the right side –"]],[5060,["if you just know the decoding, immediately you can do the diagnosis,"]],[5066,["what is wrong basically with you, and you can correct it."]],[5071,["So physically, mentally, emotionally you can correct yourself;"]],[5078,["and spiritually you ascend."]],[5082,["You ascend to a state of a saint, a sage."]],[5086,["And the time has come for us to become sages."]],[5090,["For that you don’t have to leave your homes, houses, run away from your families,"]],[5095,["nothing. That’s an escape. You don’t have to suffer."]],[5101,["You have to enter into the Kingdom of God to enjoy"]],[5106,["that beauty and bounty of His Love."]],[5110,["Now this balance is important within us."]],[5115,["There’s one more disease, a very common one in the West"]],[5121,["is the cancer of the breast in the case of women, which comes from the centre of Heart."]],[5128,["The centre, there are three hearts according to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[5133,["one is the Central Heart, one is Left and one Right."]],[5137,["Now the Central Heart is placed in the spinal cord,"]],[5142,["below the sternum bone."]],[5146,["Sternum bone is the one that creates the antibodies till the age of twelve years."]],[5152,["And then they get distributed all over."]],[5157,["And these antibodies then fight all the emergencies"]],[5161,["and overcome all the troubles for us,"]],[5165,["but then they can become also very weak."]],[5168,["So, the remote control is in the sternum bone."]],[5173,["Now this centre is the centre of a Mother,"]],[5178,["of the Primordial Mother, we can say,"]],[5181,["of the Mother Who is the Mother of this Universe and Mother of this world,"]],[5186,["Who looks after the security of children, security of the people."]],[5195,["When a woman is challenged in her motherhood,"]],[5200,["supposing she is a wife of someone"]],[5203,["and husband is giving her insecurities by any means,"]],[5207,["supposing his is a wayward person or he’s always threatening her"]],[5211,["or dominating her or challenging her,"]],[5215,["her security gets disturbed and then this trouble starts."]],[5221,["Maybe her children, maybe anyone can give this insecurity to a woman"]],[5226,["and that’s how she develops this cancer of the breast."]],[5233,["That also can be corrected if the Kundalini could be made to pass through"]],[5237,["this centre and nourish it."]],[5246,["The centre that is the most important is the seventh centre."]],[5255,["The seventh centre is the centre which is placed"]],[5259,["around the limbic area in the head,"]],[5267,["which has got one thousand petals"]],[5271,["and when enlightened, it looks like beautiful flames,"]],[5276,["very wide flames just like petals of all the seven colours."]],[5283,["That’s why it is said in the Bible, “I’ll appear before you like flames.”"]],[5293,["These are the flames, you see."]],[5299,["This is the most important thing because around the limbic area"]],[5304,["are placed all the seats, governing seats of all the centres."]],[5311,["So, if this centre is fully opened out,"]],[5320,["they all get drenched by the grace of the Divine Power"]],[5325,["and the person really, really enjoys Sahaja Yoga"]],[5330,["in the best possible way."]],[5334,["He’s a happy person, he’s a joyous person, he emits joy, he emits peace,"]],[5343,["he’s compassionate, he’s tireless, he looks after people"]],[5348,["and such a person can achieve great heights of purity within himself."]],[5356,["The another centre which is bestowed by Christ, as I told yesterday,"]],[5360,["is the Agnya Chakra, which is also very important,"]],[5366,["because Christ has said, “Thou shalt not have adulterous eyes.”"]],[5374,["That’s what He has said it. You should find out among Christian nations,"]],[5377,["how many have got such pure eyes."]],[5383,["Pure eyes means those who do not react, just witness, watch."]],[5387,["There’s no greed, there’s no lust in those eyes."]],[5392,["Such eyes are so powerful that even a glance of such an eye"]],[5396,["can give salvation."]],[5400,["And this is what it is: we have to achieve the pure eyes."]],[5406,["Such pure eyes are the only one which give you the joy of seeing."]],[5416,["Of course, you’ll have the books, you can read them"]],[5418,["and find out about all the centres and know about it."]],[5423,["But what we have to see is that the problems of the world are because of us."]],[5429,["We are the problems and we manifest the problems outside"]],[5433,["which reflect back upon us like the waves come back"]],[5438,["and dash against the shore and again are reflected back."]],[5446,["We have to, ourselves, get into the state of sages."]],[5453,["Then nobody has to tell you, “Do this” or “Do that.”"]],[5456,["You become your own master, you become your own guru,"]],[5459,["and you look after yourself."]],[5462,["I have to apologise for one thing,"]],[5465,["that Sahaja Yoga started in Australia with a little jerk."]],[5473,["They were Australians who started it,"]],[5476,["but they were not up to the mark, I must say they were not,"]],[5480,["created lots of problem for us, lots of problems."]],[5484,["And we didn’t know what to do with them. It has happened nowhere"]],[5486,["in the world as it has happened here."]],[5490,["I don’t know why it took lot of time for it to properly establish itself."]],[5498,["Thank God now we have people who are sensible"]],[5503,["and I hope you will make it convenient after getting your Realisation"]],[5506,["to establish yourself properly, establish yourself"]],[5511,["and reach that state of Nirvikalpa, doubtless awareness."]],[5517,["If you have any problem, you should write to Me directly."]],[5520,["You don’t have to bear anything. Christ has already taken the cross upon Himself,"]],[5526,["so we don’t have to do anything. If there’s any problem"]],[5530,["that you find is not all right, you should write to Me"]],[5535,["instead of getting disappointed or getting frustrated."]],[5545,["Is best is to write to Me. I know it’s far away, Australia is very far off."]],[5552,["But this is the land which is the land of purity."]],[5556,["This is the land in the universe is the first centre that you see there,"]],[5563,["and Uluru that you have – Uluru means, as I told you, is the Chaitanya,"]],[5571,["is the symbol of that purity."]],[5578,["So, you stand for the innocence of the world."]],[5583,["You are such a great nation here that stands for the innocence,"]],[5588,["and you could be very gullible. So, you have to be careful"]],[5593,["and understand your own identity as innocent people."]],[5598,["And I am sure it will work out very well for all of you."]],[5604,["And this country which has many problems will be solved"]],[5608,["by your own purity and the whole world can be helped"]],[5613,["with your own purity and beautiful lives."]],[5617,["May God bless you."]],[5636,["Yesterday we had too many questions."]],[5640,["Too many."]],[5646,["And I told you that by asking questions –"]],[5653,["I can answer all of them, I think so,"]],[5657,["but I cannot guarantee that if I answer you"]],[5661,["that means I can give you awakening. It’s not guaranteed that way."]],[5667,["So, if you want to have your Realisation"]],[5671,["and if there is any problem that stands between that Realisation and yourself,"]],[5676,["then it is better you should ask Me some question."]],[5680,["It’s much better to save time."]],[5699,["[Is raising the Kundalini dangerous?]"]],[5702,["Not at all. Kundalini is your Mother."]],[5707,["She’s your individual mother and She looks after you. She knows everything about you."]],[5716,["She’s taped everything that you have been doing, you have been desiring."]],[5720,["She knows everything about you"]],[5722,["and She’s anxiously waiting to give you your second birth."]],[5726,["As your mother took up upon herself all the labour pains,"]],[5734,["She takes all the troubles for Herself."]],[5739,["We have had so many people. I have never seen anyone getting into trouble."]],[5746,["This myth has been created by people who are money-oriented, I think,"]],[5751,["who wanted to frighten you so that you don’t go to reality and pay them well."]],[5761,["[Could You define “Kundalini”?]"]],[5766,["Yesterday I did. You came today only, madam? Oh, I see."]],[5770,["Kundalini is a power, as I told you, is a residual power,"]],[5773,["is the fourth power within us which resides in the triangular bone"]],[5779,["in three and a half coils."]],[5782,["And It rises through six centres, subtle centres."]],[5788,["This is the power of your pure desire."]],[5792,["All other desires are impure because they’re never satiable in general."]],[5799,["The only desire that is pure is to be one with the Divine."]],[5805,["[Hindi]"]],[5817,["Nanak Sahib has described as surti."]],[5821,["Kabira especially has described it as surti."]],[5824,["But imagine human beings how they are."]],[5827,["Kabira was born in Bihar, most of his work was in Bihar."]],[5834,["Later on, he went to Punjab. And in Bihar, they call tobacco as surti."]],[5844,["Yes, in Bihar they do. It’s very surprising to call tobacco as surti."]],[5853,["So many things of Granth Sahib can only be understood"]],[5855,["when you get your Self Realisation, otherwise you cannot."]],[5859,["Is said it [Hindi]."]],[5872,["What is this apa? Is your Self. He is the one who has done the tremendous work on this."]],[5879,["Tremendous work on Kundalini, all of them, Namadeva."]],[5888,["Even to think of them is great."]],[5912,["[How is that you can control your ego and all that as well as the (...)]"]],[5919,["Yah. This is the first temptation you have. Yah, yah, yah. Agreed with you"]],[5924,["that it starts giving you ego if you are not"]],[5927,["fully developed in Sahaja Yoga. This is the first temptation,"]],[5930,["I know that. But people become very creative."]],[5933,["It has happened to many Sahaja Yogis I have seen,"]],[5936,["they became very creative, they started producing lot of potteries"]],[5940,["and things, and started producing beautiful paintings."]],[5944,["There was one Australian lady she produced very beautiful paintings"]],[5948,["and she got, won fame and all that, and ego had blasted her completely."]],[5954,["And she came to see Me in Perth, I found such heat coming out of her,"]],[5957,["like a cancer patient, absolutely like a cancer patient."]],[5961,["And then if you tell her, “You have got ego”, they don’t like it,"]],[5963,["because they’re so egoistical."]],[5968,["That’s why, that's why, that's why  you have to take"]],[5973,["the Kundalini always up there. You shouldn’t be satisfied."]],[5977,["You see, that’s the slipping point sometimes, so be careful, be careful."]],[5982,["Now look at these artists, they are so simple."]],[5986,["Our attention should be, “What have I attained in Sahaja Yoga?"]],[5991,["Is my spiritual ascent”. This is just a temptation,"]],[5994,["one of the temptations that people have."]],[5998,["That’s not so important."]],[6001,["Now for these artists, the most important thing is just to play for Me,"]],[6005,["that’s all."]],[6022,["[You say we shouldn’t plan too much. Could You explain"]],[6025,["that because obviously we need to plan a little.]"]],[6032,["You see, if you are in Sahaja Yoga and in meditative mood."]],[6039,["If you’re in a meditative mood and if you’re in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[6046,["then you just don’t plan,"]],[6049,["because you know the planning is already done for you."]],[6054,["I know that if you take the name of “airport”, only “airport”,"]],[6060,["you take the name and most of the men will start jumping."]],[6065,["They’ll go at least one hour earlier than reporting time."]],[6070,["Aeroplane is not going to fly out, you see, but they fear that it will fly out."]],[6077,["Now, if you are a Sahaja Yogi and if you are going for catching a plane,"]],[6084,["say example, you should know what time you have to leave"]],[6089,["and you leave at that time, you’ll reach there in time."]],[6093,["You don’t have to see, watch all the time, you’ll just leave at that time,"]],[6095,["exactly at that time, you’ll leave. But also, if you are a little late,"]],[6101,["the plane will be for you."]],[6103,["But you don’t want to be unkind and the Paramachaitanya looks after you."]],[6111,["You’ll just remember you have to go now, you leave that time."]],[6115,["It is so simple."]],[6117,["But to believe that Somebody Else is planning us is beyond our ego."]],[6127,["What is it?"]],[6140,["[He says if he has to leave the planning of his life"]],[6143,["to someone else, he’s denying his own individuality,"]],[6153,["he’s denying that fact that he creates his own life"]],[6156,["if he leaves the planning.]"]],[6158,["That’s a good one, in a way is good."]],[6162,["Why do you want to have this kind of a feeling that you are creating the world?"]],[6166,["Nobody’s creating. You can’t even create even a grain of clay."]],[6172,["No, you can’t. You can’t create anything."]],[6178,["What’s he saying?"]],[6180,["[He says he’s creating his own experience now"]],[6183,["just by raising his right hand or his left hand.]"]],[6194,["You see you have to be little deeper to understand the significance."]],[6197,["Also to have faith in yourself"]],[6200,["that supposing you become connected with the Divine Power."]],[6205,["Now, I’ll tell you what. Supposing you see a television. All right?"]],[6211,["The television is connected to the mains there. All right."]],[6215,["Now you want to see Shakespeare, for example, that’s your plan."]],[6219,["But there’s another plan there going on, and when you open,"]],[6223,["it’s not Shakespeare, it’s something else. So, what do you do?"]],[6227,["Do you loose your identity?"]],[6242,["Now it’s all right for him."]],[6245,["All right, you follow My advice and you’ll see what I am saying."]],[6248,["All right? Now just give it a chance. Give it a chance."]],[6252,["First of all, get your Realisation and give it a chance. All right?"]],[6274,["What she is saying?"]],[6276,["[What is the best way to go towards Self Realisation?]"]],[6281,["That’s what we are going to do. All right? That’s a very good question."]],[6284,["You just wait. After all these questions are over, we’ll have that."]],[6312,["[He says he understands why our own actions cause"]],[6316,["imbalances in ourselves but how about young children?"]],[6319,["How do these diseases get caused in young children?]"]],[6322,["Now for example, a mother is a very busy lady. When the child is there,"]],[6325,["she’s doing all kinds of work and thinking too much, running too much."]],[6329,["Or the father is doing that, that has an effect on the child."]],[6332,["You see, human beings are delicately made."]],[6337,["I mean in ancient times, if a woman was to have a baby,"]],[6341,["she used to take it very easy"]],[6345,["and she used to read something spiritual,"]],[6350,["she used to be thinking about her child"]],[6354,["and feeling that motherhood within herself."]],[6359,["But the mother doesn’t think of the child. She just thinks she has to today go for hairdo"]],[6366,["or she has to do something, face lifting or something like that."]],[6373,["I don’t know much about these things, but that’s what I’ve seen."]],[6379,["It’s too much of superficiality"]],[6386,["And this has killed the beauty even of romance, you’ll be surprised."]],[6391,["Absolutely, it’s absurd."]],[6396,["These hair dressers have ruined the beauty of women in the way"]],[6402,["because somebody likes one particular type of hair dress,"]],[6406,["he falls in love with the hair dress. Now she changes her hair dress,"]],[6409,["he wants to have a divorce with her."]],[6412,["So superficial attachments to superficial things."]],[6416,["There’s no deeper attachments to innate,"]],[6424,["something so natural."]],[6430,["Artificial things cannot lead us anywhere,"]],[6433,["they can never give us joy."]],[6452,["[He is wanting Realisation futuristic?]"]],[6454,["Good. Good. Now what is she wanting here, this lady?"]],[6460,["That’s what I’m going to do, I’m very happy, that part you just forget,"]],[6463,["the rest of it. Is there any other question? Now let’s see."]],[6479,["Will we see a time when most of the world will have their Realisation?]"]],[6482,["I hope so."]],[6485,["I hope so."]],[6491,["I would say that’s My dream. I wish, I wish that happens."]],[6510,["I’m actually desireless. But your desires work."]],[6516,["If you desire. Is the other way round. It’s not, “Thy will be done,”"]],[6520,["but it’s “Thy will be done.”"]],[6523,["If you desire, it will happen, it will happen."]],[6552,["[Is it wrong to want or desire a family and have unity in a family"]],[6556,["and to enjoy the normal pleasures of life?]"]],[6559,["Not at all. I mean, we are marrying so many people."]],[6564,["It’s not at all. It’s the best thing to have a family and children."]],[6569,["But not to get involved so much into your family"]],[6572,["that you forget your ascent."]],[6574,["How many times you are married in previous lives"]],[6576,["and how many children you have had in previous lives?"]],[6579,["Now this is the time for your ascent"]],[6582,["and your family should be complimentary."]],[6585,["If it is not complimentary, it’s not going to help you. It is your choice,"]],[6589,["you’re free will. If you want to get dissolved into your own children,"]],[6594,["and your family only and not to have any ascent,"]],[6597,["nobody can force you, go ahead with it."]],[6600,["But this time is important."]],[6602,["This is an important time. Of course, you have to have family;"]],[6605,["of course, you have to get married. You have to lead a very normal life."]],[6610,["Nothing abnormal. But if somebody is too much attached to the family,"]],[6615,["forgets his own ascent, then I think he is missing the point."]],[6620,["That is the most important thing in life. Yes, please?"]],[6632,["[Isn’t the greatest danger in the future over population?]"]],[6637,["No, not at all. Actually, there are no imbalances"]],[6639,["that’s why there is a population growth in some countries"]],[6642,["and no population in some countries."]],[6645,["Like on the BBC gentleman came and asked Me in London,"]],[6651,["he said, “Why do you have such a population growth?”"]],[6654,["First, he asked, I mean they are, you know after all,"]],[6657,["they can ask very funny questions."]],[6659,["They have every right to do what they like."]],[6662,["So, first question he asked, “Why? Wwhy is it in India"]],[6667,["you have so much poverty?”"]],[6669,["I said, “If you have a guest for three hundred years in your country,"]],[6673,["what will happen to you? You’ll become a broke.”"]],[6683,["Then he said that, “Such a population growth in Your country,"]],[6687,["what about that?” I said, “If you can allow Me,"]],[6690,["very humbly I would state you are responsible for that also.”"]],[6693,["He said, “How are we responsible?”"]],[6695,["I said, “In England, I used to hear that"]],[6700,["two children are killed every week in England by their parents.”"]],[6708,["He said, “No, only in London.” I said, “Really? That’s the case?"]],[6712,["So, what child, which child would like to be born in this country?”"]],[6719,["That’s why you see in Germany it’s minus, Sweden is minus,"]],[6723,["Norway is minus. All these countries are having minus growth"]],[6728,["and people are competing in committing suicide."]],[6732,["Switzerland, there’s a competition on."]],[6735,["All these countries are supposed to be affluent countries"]],[6738,["where they have money, they can look after their children better,"]],[6741,["they are competing in having suicides and in having minus growth."]],[6746,["But in India, even if you have ten children or twelve children,"]],[6749,["love is all the time there available to them."]],[6752,["And what a child needs is love, not all these pomp and show"]],[6756,["that you should have a nice cot or a nice this, but a loving mother."]],[6762,["That’s why they come to India. Now if you create such mothers,"]],[6764,["they’ll come to you also."]],[6802,["What is he saying? Question of woman and man, he is saying what?"]],[6807,["What exactly he did say?"]],[6820,["[How long should a man or a woman sleep?]"]],[6826,["You see, there’s no hard and fast rule for that,"]],[6829,["actually. I think as you grow old, you don’t sleep so much;"]],[6833,["I personally think that way. I sleep very little, Myself."]],[6839,["In the night about three hours; in the daytime about one hour or so."]],[6845,["But depends on, it depends."]],[6848,["So, for sleeping, there’s no hard and fast rule,"]],[6853,["but whatever time you are born, that’s the time you want to sleep."]],[6859,["So, some people like to sleep in the morning, all right let them sleep."]],[6862,["And some people want to sleep in the night, let them sleep. Makes no difference."]],[6867,["But after coming to Sahaja Yoga, all these conditionings disappear."]],[6871,["And then you start behaving in a different manner."]],[6874,["There’s a transformation."]],[6876,["And then maximum time, you want to give for your meditation,"]],[6880,["for knowing about Sahaja Yoga, and you get more time."]],[6885,["Actually, we should have much more time than our ancestors."]],[6889,["You know, we don’t have to go to the jungles to get our wood for our fire,"]],[6894,["we don’t have to do all the rest of the things they used to do."]],[6897,["Poor things, they had to go for hunting."]],[6900,["Now we have everything in the house already made, I mean, instant. Isn’t it?"]],[6908,["And we have the watch on all of the time watching the watch."]],[6912,["But we have no time. We are the worst."]],[6916,["They had more time than we have."]],[6920,["So where are we spending the time?"]],[6923,["While coming here, I just asked him, “What do they make?”"]],[6927,["Because I was seeing all Chinese things, Japanese things,"]],[6931,["and then I saw lots of Greek,"]],[6936,["and most of them were Italian things in the market, shops."]],[6940,["I said, “What do the Australians make?”"]],[6942,["He said, “They make lager.”"]],[6945,["Where do we spend our time? In the ballroom dancing? Or in the lager?"]],[6952,["Or in some way destroying ourselves with drugs or something like that?"]],[6955,["We have no time, we have time for drugs, all right."]],[6959,["Then parties, some formal things which have no meaning at all."]],[6965,["It conveys nothing. I have been now in London in a position"]],[6969,["where I had to shake hands with six to seven hundred people."]],[6972,["And only I remember the horrible things that happen to the hand,"]],[6977,["otherwise I don’t remember even the faces of the people."]],[6984,["So, there should be a better method"]],[6986,["of developing a rapport between us,"]],[6989,["understanding each other in much more natural way."]],[6992,["And then we have time, this is the time to enjoy."]],[6997,["But nobody enjoys because we are so time bound,"]],[7001,["we are so time bound. Only time to enjoy we don’t have."]],[7006,["And that’s how whatever you people say about sleeping or waking up"]],[7011,["and all that is that your regulation doesn’t come from the Divine."]],[7017,["If it is from the Divine, you just enjoy,"]],[7023,["you just enjoy your life, you enjoy yourself."]],[7027,["Never feel ill or sick. And now I am sixty-seven,"]],[7031,["every day I’m giving lectures, morning, evening."]],[7035,["And the smokes, the way people smoke, women,"]],[7039,["especially in Australia, I don’t know what has gone wrong with them,"]],[7041,["I try to go with the women, so that I’ll be saved from smoking,"]],[7045,["they smoke more than the men even here."]],[7050,["So, I’ve developed a throat trouble, I hope it will be all right."]],[7053,["But this is what happens. Where do we spend our time?"]],[7060,["There then you are beyond time,"]],[7064,["into the timeless dimension enjoying yourself."]],[7070,["That’s the beauty we have to achieve; that state we have to reach."]],[7076,["All right?"]],[7080,["What is it?"]],[7082,["[He says, my revered father has been for the past three or four years"]],[7086,["experiencing astral sounds,"]],[7089,["but physically his hearing is impaired"]],[7094,["or cut off for all practical purposes."]],[7098,["Twenty-four hours a day he is able to tune into"]],[7101,["the chanting of sacred Hindu hymns, devotional music"]],[7105,["rendered by an enchanting voice that accompanied by a violin, etcetera."]],[7110,["He has done no special tapas or meditation, but he is very naïve"]],[7116,["and a simple soul. Is it because of the awakening of the Kundalini?]"]],[7120,["No, not at all."]],[7123,["Not at all. All these things should not happen to you."]],[7128,["You don’t hear anything, you don’t see anything, you become,"]],[7133,["you just become."]],[7138,["This is a subject which has to be dealt with clearly"]],[7142,["about the dead souls and things, it’s quite a big subject."]],[7146,["But if you come to Sahaja Yoga, you’ll understand what happens,"]],[7148,["how you hear these things and how astral things happen,"]],[7152,["how your cot deaths take place. All these are all negative things"]],[7157,["and are achieved by people who deal in the science of the dead."]],[7167,["Which is very important that you should get out of all these ideas"]],[7174,["and become your Self."]],[7176,["Only way to know if a person is Realised is not,"]],[7181,["the way he can handle the Kundalini,"]],[7187,["the way he can feel the vibrations,"]],[7190,["and the way he leads his own life."]],[7193,["When you go to any guru, first of all see the disciples,"]],[7196,["how they are, how they behave, what powers they have got."]],[7202,["Then you accept. That’s the sign of a satguru."]],[7207,["Nanaka has said clearly. Guru Nanak was such an enlightened soul"]],[7212,["and he said that, “The one who meets you, meet God, is the satguru.”"]],[7217,["Everybody is not a guru."]],[7227,["So, should we now have the Realisation?"]],[7242,["[Hindi]"]],[7300,["That’s for only Indians."]],[7304,["Indians abroad."]],[7313,["Now should we now finish that?"]],[7321,["Can we take out our shoes?"]],[7324,["Because we have to take the help of the Mother Earth."]],[7335,["As I’ve told you, it cannot be forced."]],[7339,["I respect your freedom, respect your freedom. It’s your free will."]],[7346,["If you want to have your Realisation only you can have,"]],[7349,["otherwise you cannot. It cannot be forced on you."]],[7355,["So those who do not want should leave the hall"]],[7359,["to be civil to other people."]],[7363,["Otherwise you are welcome."]],[7367,["There are two conditions in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[7371,["at least when you are getting your Realisation."]],[7374,["First is to forget your past, to forgive yourself."]],[7380,["You should be pleasantly placed towards yourself,"]],[7384,["pleasantly placed towards yourself."]],[7389,["And second one is that you have to forgive everyone."]],[7401,["As I told you yesterday, whether you forgive or don’t forgive,"]],[7405,["you don’t do anything. Actually, if you don’t forgive,"]],[7408,["then you play into wrong hands. So just neglect it, completely."]],[7413,["Don’t worry about it. And in general, you should say,"]],[7416,["“I forgive everyone.” Just say in general, “I forgive everyone.”"]],[7422,["That’s all."]],[7427,["Not to count how many people you have to forgive,"]],[7430,["not to know about everyone, what they have said to you,"]],[7433,["but just forgive in general. That’s all."]],[7436,["So, the first one is to forget your past."]],[7439,["That means not to feel guilty at all."]],[7442,["You’re not to feel guilty. After all, you are a human being"]],[7446,["and human beings can only commit mistakes. You’re not gods."]],[7451,["So, what does it matter?"]],[7454,["There’s nothing to bother you on that point, should not."]],[7458,["So please forgive yourself and forgive others."]],[7462,["That’s very important."]],[7465,["These are the two simple conditions. But mentally, you should accept them."]],[7473,["Now, we have to put both our feet little away from each other,"]],[7477,["because you know there are two powers within us, left and right."]],[7482,["And we use our left hand symbolically to suggest"]],[7486,["that we want our Self Realisation and this is the power of desire,"]],[7491,["not of Pure Desire, but desire."]],[7494,["And we use our right hand which is the power of action"]],[7497,["to nourish our centres on the left-hand side."]],[7499,["We’ll be nourishing our left-hand centres only."]],[7508,["So now you please put your left hand,"]],[7510,["comfortably the way you want to put it, it will hardly take ten minutes,"]],[7516,["and use your right hand, as I show you now"]],[7521,["and then we have to close our eyes."]],[7525,["First, put it on your heart."]],[7528,["This is the centre where resides the Spirit,"]],[7532,["so is a very important centre."]],[7537,["Then you take down your right hand in the upper portion"]],[7541,["of your abdomen on the left-hand side which is the centre of your mastery"]],[7547,["created by great masters."]],[7553,["Now take down your right hand again"]],[7556,["to the lower portion of your abdomen."]],[7560,["It is the centre –"]],[7563,["I hope you can see it, just come forward a little bit if you don’t mind –"]],[7565,["please, thank you."]],[7569,["This is the centre of Pure Knowledge, Pure Knowledge"]],[7573,["that acts on your central nervous system."]],[7579,["Then you raise again your hand up"]],[7583,["on to the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,"]],[7585,["press it hard. Then, on to your heart."]],[7590,["Then into the corner of your neck and your head."]],[7595,["Press it as back as possible and turn your head to your right."]],[7601,["This centre you catch when you feel guilty."]],[7609,["Now you take your hand and put it on your forehead."]],[7615,["And put down your head on it, press it hard."]],[7625,["This is the centre to forgive others."]],[7629,["Take your right hand on the back side of your head"]],[7633,["and please raise your head towards the sky."]],[7648,["This is the centre to ask for forgiveness from Divine without feeling guilty."]],[7656,["Then stretch your palm."]],[7659,["Put the centre of your palm on top of the fontanel bone area"]],[7665,["which was a soft bone in your childhood."]],[7670,["Bend your head."]],[7672,["Now, stretch your fingers outward,"]],[7679,["outward as much as you can, put a pressure on your scalp,"]],[7684,["and move your scalp clockwise."]],[7693,["Seven times very slowly."]],[7718,["Now, that’s all we have to do."]],[7726,["Now you can close your eyes, put your left hand towards Me."]],[7730,["Be careful, you keep your feet apart."]],[7732,["Those who are sitting on the ground are all right."]],[7738,["And now close your eyes. You can take out your spectacles if you want to,"]],[7742,["because don’t have to open the eyes till I tell you."]],[7762,["Now, please put your left hand towards Me,"]],[7768,["and right hand on your heart."]],[7777,["Now close your eyes. Please don’t open them till I tell you."]],[7791,["Here you have to ask Me a question,"]],[7793,["a very important question."]],[7796,["You can call me “Mother” or you can call Me “Shri Mataji”,"]],[7800,["whatever you like, very important question."]],[7811,["Ask a question three times in your heart, not loudly, please:"]],[7817,["“Mother, am I the Spirit?”"]],[7821,["“Mother, am I the Spirit?” Ask this question three times."]],[7833,["If you are the Spirit,"]],[7837,["you are your own guide, you are your own master."]],[7846,["So now please bring down your hand, right hand,"]],[7850,["in the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,"]],[7853,["press it hard, and here, ask another question three times,"]],[7858,["“Mother, am I my own master?”"]],[7862,["Ask this question three times: “Mother, am I my own master?”"]],[7884,["Now, as I told you, I respect your freedom,"]],[7891,["and you have a free will."]],[7894,["I cannot force Pure Knowledge on you, it cannot be."]],[7899,["You have to ask for it. So now take your right hand"]],[7903,["in the lower portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side"]],[7910,["and ask Me,"]],[7916,["“Mother, please give me Pure Knowledge.”"]],[7922,["Six times, because this centre has got six petals."]],[7928,["“Mother, please give me Pure Knowledge."]],[7942,["As soon as you ask this question, the Kundalini starts moving upward."]],[7950,["So now we have to nourish the upper centres"]],[7954,["to make Its movement, Her movement, faster."]],[7962,["So please raise your right hand"]],[7966,["on the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,"]],[7970,["press it hard and here you say with full confidence,"]],[7975,["with full confidence you say, “Mother, I am my own master.”"]],[7986,["Please say it ten times, “Mother, I am my own master.”"]],[7998,["These things remove your conditionings"]],[8003,["from wrong teachings."]],[8012,["Now you raise your hand,"]],[8020,["the most important question"]],[8029,["that is you are not your body, you are not your intelligence,"]],[8045,["you’re not your emotions, you are not your conditionings, your ego,"]],[8052,["your thoughts, but you are pure Spirit."]],[8062,["So, raise your right hand on to your heart"]],[8068,["and say with full confidence twelve times,"]],[8074,["full confidence please, “Mother, I am the Spirit.”"]],[8080,["Just say that, “Mother, I am the Spirit.” Please say it twelve times."]],[8104,["Now, raise your right hand"]],[8111,["to another very important area within us"]],[8116,["where, by feeling guilty all the time,"]],[8119,["we have harmed a very important centre."]],[8124,["I have to tell you that the Divine Power"]],[8129,["is the Ocean of Knowledge and Love."]],[8135,["It is the Ocean of Bliss and Joy."]],[8141,["But above all, above all it is the Ocean of Forgiveness,"]],[8150,["and whatever mistakes or wrongs you have done"]],[8154,["are dissolved by the power of forgiveness."]],[8159,["So, raise your right hand"]],[8161,["into the corner of your neck and your shoulder"]],[8167,["and turn your head to your right."]],[8173,["Here you have to say with full confidence sixteen times,"]],[8180,["“Mother, I’m not guilty at all.”"]],[8184,["Again, you say, “Mother, I am not guilty at all.”"]],[8191,["Sixteen times."]],[8198,["I’ve already told you whether you forgive others or not,"]],[8207,["you’re not doing anything, it is a myth."]],[8210,["But if you don’t forgive others,"]],[8213,["then you fall into the wrong hands and torture yourself for nothing."]],[8229,["So now, please raise your right hand onto your forehead across,"]],[8234,["press it hard on both the sides"]],[8237,["and put down your head as far as possible,"]],[8240,["resting on your hand, and press it on both the sides."]],[8246,["This is the centre where you have to forgive,"]],[8249,["forgive others, forgive others."]],[8265,["Just say, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[8269,["Without thinking about them"]],[8273,["or thinking about what they have done to you, just say in general,"]],[8277,["“Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[8292,["Now, how many times is not the point, from your heart."]],[8301,["You must say it properly. Yesterday so many didn’t say"]],[8304,["and I had to work very hard on them. So please say it,"]],[8308,["please say it from your heart once for all, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[8323,["Now take back your hand on the back side of your head,"]],[8327,["on the optic globe and now raise it higher"]],[8333,["and let it rest on your hand."]],[8344,["Here you have to say for your own satisfaction,"]],[8356,["not feeling guilty, not counting your mistakes,"]],[8360,["“Oh Divine Power, if I have done any mistakes, please forgive me.”"]],[8368,["Say it from your heart."]],[8380,["Now,"]],[8384,["stretch your palm, keeping your left hand towards Me."]],[8390,["This is the most important centre. Both the feet apart from each other."]],[8395,["Keep yourself straight and put your right hand,"]],[8400,["the centre of your palm, on top of the fontanel bone area,"]],[8406,["the soft bone which you had in your childhood, and press it."]],[8412,["Now bend your head as much as you can, press back your fingers,"]],[8418,["press back your thumb,"]],[8421,["so there’s a pressure on your scalp, nicely pressurised."]],[8425,["Now move it, move it slowly seven times."]],[8431,["Here again I cannot, I’m sorry,"]],[8435,["I cannot disrespect your freedom and free will."]],[8440,["You have to ask for your Self Realisation, it cannot be forced on you."]],[8445,["So, seven times, please say seven times,"]],[8449,["“Mother, please give me my Self Realisation.” Please say it seven times."]],[8509,["Now please take down your both the hands and open your eyes slowly,"]],[8514,["very slowly. Now watch Me without thinking."]],[8520,["You can do it."]],[8525,["Now, put up your right hand like this and bend your head"]],[8530,["and see for yourself if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your head."]],[8538,["Bend your head. It is above your head, not on."]],[8544,["So little away from the head, try to feel if there’s a cool breeze"]],[8548,["coming out of your head. You can take your hand a little further."]],[8554,["Some people have it quite away from the head."]],[8559,["So, see for yourself if there’s a cool breeze coming out."]],[8566,["Now, put the left hand towards Me and put down your head."]],[8575,["Now see for yourself, again with the right hand,"]],[8579,["if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your head."]],[8581,["Some people will get heat coming out, doesn’t matter,"]],[8584,["it will later on be followed by cool breeze also."]],[8588,["You see yourself if there is the cool breeze coming."]],[8590,["Bend your head properly, that’s important."]],[8594,["Now, again put your right hand towards Me"]],[8599,["and bend your head. Now don’t doubt. The breeze is coming from inside"]],[8603,["and not from the air conditioner, so see for yourself."]],[8606,["Again, this is the Cool Breeze of the Holy Ghost,"]],[8609,["this Kundalini is the Holy Ghost. Now see."]],[8624,["Now raise your both the hands towards the sky,"]],[8630,["push back your head and here you ask a question,"]],[8635,["“Mother, is this the Cool Breeze of the Holy Ghost?”"]],[8639,["“Mother, is this the All Pervading Power of Divine Love?”"]],[8643,["“Mother, is this the Paramchaitanya?” Ask any one of these questions"]],[8648,["three times."]],[8650,["Push back your head fully and ask this question."]],[8659,["Separate your hands; don’t put them together."]],[8662,["Separate your hands."]],[8665,["May God bless you. Bring down your hands, please."]],[8669,["You can watch Me without thinking."]],[8674,["Now those who have felt the cool breeze"]],[8678,["or even a hot breeze out of their heads or on their fingertips,"]],[8683,["please raise both your hands."]],[8691,["The whole of Sydney is drowned into the Ocean of Joy."]],[8696,["May God bless you. So, the Kundalini has sprouted,"]],[8702,["Kundalini has come out,"]],[8707,["you are connected with That, but you have to establish yourself."]],[8713,["Otherwise it would be like the marshy land"]],[8717,["where Christ has described some seeds fell down,"]],[8721,["they sprouted and were destroyed."]],[8726,["Must respect our Self Realisation, we must respect ourselves."]],[8730,["Now you have become saints"]],[8733,["and you have to understand that it’s a glorious thing"]],[8740,["that is happening to you, and you now become the instrument of God."]],[8748,["You can come to the follow-on program,"]],[8753,["they have nice courses for you, something."]],[8756,["You don’t have to pay anything, but you have to give some time,"]],[8759,["that’s all, and within a month you’ll find you’ll become masters."]],[8765,["Master of yourself and master of this art of yoga."]],[8771,["They’ll answer all your questions."]],[8773,["They’ll see to it that it works out."]],[8776,["Now we have very good, humble people who’ll look after you,"]],[8781,["and they have all the knowledge, and you can also get My tapes"]],[8785,["and things where I tell you about,"]],[8787,["three to four thousand tapes are there only in English language,"]],[8791,["and in Hindi, Marathi and that way."]],[8795,["But unless and until you are established, I would not like you"]],[8798,["to read books about it, because then again, you’ll get lost."]],[8801,["So, first thing is to establish yourself fully,"]],[8804,["so you don’t get lost into your ego, as you were saying,"]],[8808,["or into any such trips. Better get established first,"]],[8811,["then nothing makes you feel that way."]],[8816,["May God bless you all."]],[8818,["I’ll be coming after one year and I hope all of you will become great trees"]],[8827,["giving the beautiful vibrations to this great country of innocence"]],[8832,["and changing everyone."]],[8835,["The transformation within you will definitely help to change"]],[8839,["so many things in this country and you’ll be amazed"]],[8843,["how the planning of the Divine works for you every moment"]],[8847,["and how you’re helped and looked after, guided and protected."]],[8851,["It’s very surprising."]],[8853,["May God bless you."]],[8864,["Yesterday I met most of you people."]],[8866,["Those whom I have not met and who have got Realisation,"]],[8869,["I would like to meet. It’s already it is ten-thirty."]],[8871,["We had a music program."]],[8875,["But whom I have met is all right."]],[8877,["Those who haven’t got Realisation can come on one side. They can see."]],[8881,["Those whom I have not met and who have got Realisation,"]],[8884,["can come and meet Me."]]]);
